    {
      "id": "claim_4b77e0178b414430b01b006e7076efae",
      "statement": "Merge conflicts are routed, not swallowed: _handle_local_merge_conflict and _handle_pr_conflict_from_github increment conflict_retries and send a conflicted task back to zf-builder for conflict resolution rather than aborting; once the conflict-retry budget is exceeded the first exhaustion stamps triage_phase='recovery' and routes the task to zf-orchestrator for one autonomous diagnostic attempt (when orchestrator_recovery_count < 1), otherwise parking it in blocked for a human.",
      "evidence": [
